&lt;h1&gt;


  Implementing Dynamic ISO‑27001 Dashboard Pages with Next .js 14 Server Actions
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TL;DR:&lt;/strong&gt; I added a set of dynamic routes, server actions, and type‑safe validation to expose ISO 27001 “aperturas” and related data behind authentication. The changes isolate public‑facing pages, remove project‑specific metadata, and let the UI query the master tables securely.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  The Problem
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The ISO 27001 dashboard started as a collection of static pages that were tightly coupled to the development environment. When we opened the app to internal users we hit several blockers:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Public surface leaked project identifiers&lt;/strong&gt; – URLs, meta tags, and bundled JavaScript referenced the internal repo name (&lt;code&gt;iso27001-tablero&lt;/code&gt;), which broke the “neutral public surface” policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Authentication was only a front‑end guard&lt;/strong&gt; – the pages rendered data without server‑side checks, exposing the master tables to unauthenticated requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Routing for “aperturas” (open controls) was missing&lt;/strong&gt; – we needed a URL pattern like &lt;code&gt;/aperturas/:slug/:id&lt;/code&gt; that could render both a list view and a detail view, but the existing code only handled a flat &lt;code&gt;/aperturas&lt;/code&gt; page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Data mutation (create / edit) was scattered across client components&lt;/strong&gt; – leading to duplicated validation logic and inconsistent error handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The error we saw in the console was a 401 response from the API when trying to fetch an apertura without a session token, and the HTML source still contained &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;meta name="project" content="iso27001-tablero"&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, which the security audit flagged.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  What I Tried First
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;My first attempt was to &lt;strong&gt;reuse the existing &lt;code&gt;app/(app)/aperturas/page.tsx&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; as a catch‑all route and fetch data client‑side with &lt;code&gt;fetch('/api/aperturas')&lt;/code&gt;. I wrapped the request in a &lt;code&gt;useEffect&lt;/code&gt; hook and added a simple &lt;code&gt;if (!session) router.push('/login')&lt;/code&gt; guard.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Problems with that approach:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The client fetch bypassed the server‑side auth middleware, so the API still returned data to anyone who could sniff the network request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The component re‑rendered twice (once empty, once with data), causing a noticeable flash of unauthenticated content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation was duplicated in the API route and the client form, leading to mismatched error messages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I also tried &lt;strong&gt;adding a custom &lt;code&gt;_middleware.ts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to protect the whole &lt;code&gt;/aperturas&lt;/code&gt; folder, but Next 13’s app router does not honor middleware at the segment level, so the middleware never ran.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At that point I decided to switch to &lt;strong&gt;Next.js 14 server actions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic route segments&lt;/strong&gt; to keep everything on the server, enforce auth once, and centralize validation.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  The Implementation
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  1. New Dynamic Routes
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;


  &lt;code&gt;app/(app)/aperturas/[slug]/page.tsx&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h4&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;next/link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;notFound&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;next/navigation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;DataTable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Row&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;@/components/data-table&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Progress&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;@/components/master-ui&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;flat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;SP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;@/lib/action-util&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;getAperturaList&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;@/lib/aperturas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;AperturaList&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;slug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;getAperturaList&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;slug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;notFound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"text-2xl"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;flat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;slug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; Aperturas&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;DataTable&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
